# n8n workflows

## Canonical location

All workflow exports live in **`n8n/`** at repo root:

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `n8n/booker.json` | Slot → merge student → POST booker webhook |
| `n8n/watcher-v3.json` | Cairo/Kairo slot scanner |

`python-booker-webhook/workflows/booker.json` is a convenience copy — update both or document why they differ.

## Booker HTTP node requirements

- URL: `POST …/webhook/booker` (turbo)
- Timeout: **300000 ms**
- Body must include: `runId`, `sessionCookie`, `Office`, `CalendarId`, `currentMonday`, `currentSlot`, `student`
- Retry: 2 attempts, 60s wait (handles 503 `BOOKING_SERVER_BUSY`)

## Result handling

Booker returns structured JSON — handle in n8n switch: SUCCESS, CAPTCHA_FAIL, SLOT_TAKEN, ALREADY_BOOKED. See `docs/n8n-booking-result-flow.md`.

## Sandboxes

Lock-integration experiments: `sandboxes/lock-integration-v1/workflows/` + `docs/n8n-workflow-ids.json`. Do not merge sandbox workflows into production without explicit review.

## Naming

- No spaces in filenames (`watcher-v3.json`, not `Austria Kairo … .json`)
- No duplicate `current`/`latest` copies at repo root — one canonical name in `n8n/`
